  "title": "United Bank Customer Care Named Service Team of the Year by the National Customer Service Association",
  "summary": "CHARLESTON, WV – United Bank is proud to announce that its Customer Care team has been named Service Team of the Year in the National Customer Service Association’s (NCSA) 2025 All-Star Awards. Competing against organizations across industries – including education, financial services, health care, and nonprofits – United’s Customer Care team earned the No. 1 spot in the group or team category.",
